# ~380MB of public-benchmark ground-truth (KAIST/EuRoC/TUM-VI/UZH-FPV) — irrelevant to
# real-hardware D435+PX4 VIO, kept locally but not worth the repo weight. package.xml/
# CMakeLists.txt stay tracked so the colcon package itself still exists.
src/open_vins/ov_data/*
!src/open_vins/ov_data/package.xml
!src/open_vins/ov_data/CMakeLists.txt

# same rationale, different location: 7.4MB upstream eval-demo ground-truth file,
